[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[draw=black,text=black,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-.3,0)--(8.4,0);
\foreach \v in {0,20,40,60,80,100} {\draw ({.08*\v},-.08)--({.08*\v},.08);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at ({.08*\v},-.16) {$\v$};}
\node[below] at (4,-.65) {Score};
\foreach \name/\y/\lo/\qone/\med/\qthree/\hi in {A/1.3/13/29/46/63/88,B/2.8/19/38/52/59/81} {
\node[left] at (-.4,\y) {\name};
\draw[thick] ({.08*\lo},\y)--({.08*\qone},\y);
\draw[thick] ({.08*\qthree},\y)--({.08*\hi},\y);
\draw[thick] ({.08*\lo},{\y-.2})--({.08*\lo},{\y+.2});
\draw[thick] ({.08*\hi},{\y-.2})--({.08*\hi},{\y+.2});
\draw[thick,fill=none] ({.08*\qone},{\y-.4}) rectangle ({.08*\qthree},{\y+.4});
\draw[thick] ({.08*\med},{\y-.4})--({.08*\med},{\y+.4});
\foreach \v in {\lo,\qone,\med,\qthree,\hi} {\node[above] at ({.08*\v},{\y+.5}) {$\v$};}
}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
The plots summarise test marks for two classes.
(a) Which class has the higher median?
(b) Find each range and IQR. Which class has the more consistent middle half?
(c) Which class has the higher maximum? Explain why that does not decide which class has the higher median.

