The crews assemble the same kit; a lower time is faster.
(a) Which crew has the lower median time?
(b) Using the box plot, estimate whether Crew B finished in less than $33$ minutes more or less than half the time.
(c) Using the box plot, estimate the percentage of Crew B times below $36$ minutes.

